            // For "1  s" with double space, unit starts at 3, still valid.
            // So skipping spaces is okay.
            // But we need to track unit start correctly.
            // Let's handle: skip spaces, then unit_start = i
        }
        // Actually we already consumed spaces, but we need to re-evaluate: we skipped spaces, now i points to unit start or end/next number
        // Now parse unit letters
